Inject pre-2e0268e behaviour: the parser's sublevel loop does not
accept OWS (a bare space) between the subtype and the `;` that
introduces parameters. Parsing "text/plain ;charset=utf-8" fails with
InvalidToken at the space, but "text/plain;charset=utf-8" still
succeeds. Minimal mutation: remove the OWS match arm the fix added at
mime-parse/src/rfc7231.rs.

